<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Ogos 2019. Pindaan seksyen 6"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/msa@/~cl_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/msa@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/22/msa@> .
